{"version":1,"content":"<p>西藏那曲市巴青縣昨（22日）晚發生7.0級地震，為內地今年最大強度地震。</p><p>截至今午12時，中國地震台網共錄得餘震501次，其中3級以下474次，目前最大餘震為4.3級。</p><p>內地地質專家分析，今次強震屬青藏高原罕見的「拉張型」地震；</p><p>且因震源淺，次生災害風險高。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:43.372189+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:31:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T14:18:09.724958+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.859348+00:00","content_hash":"0ab380f75d305c16ccc63f975f8a2262cb2801a3ca8b0c5e5c70dd256583022c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}